A cozy orange couch floating in deep space, surrounded by swirling galaxies and nebulae in purple and blue hues, with small glowing database cylinder icons orbiting around it like moons. The couch has a warm, inviting glow emanating from within, casting soft light into the cosmic void. Scattered around the scene are translucent geometric shapes representing data structures and JSON brackets, rendered as constellations. The composition suggests companionship and comfort in the vast complexity of data management. Style: Vincent van Gogh with bold, expressive brushstrokes creating swirling starry night textures in the cosmic background, thick impasto technique on the couch's fabric, and characteristic post-impressionist color palette of deep blues, vibrant oranges, and luminous yellows.
